{"l":5765,"g":7,"b":1,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'It's a secret, so you ___ tell anyone about the party.'","o":["mustn't","mustn't to","don't must","not must"],"a":"mustn't","r":"'Mustn't' + verbum uden 'to' betyder, at man ikke må."},
