{"l":5813,"g":7,"b":1,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'They ___ in a small flat until they bought a house in 2019.'","o":["have lived","lived","live","are living"],"a":"lived","r":"Det er afsluttet i 2019, så man bruger datid: 'lived'."},
{"l":5819,"g":7,"b":1,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'Max used to hate vegetables. Now he grows his own carrots and eats them straight from the garden.' Hvad har ændret sig for Max?","o":["Han har fået en ny have","Han spiser ikke længere gulerødder","Han kan nu lide grøntsager","Han arbejder som gartner"],"a":"Han kan nu lide grøntsager","r":"'Used to hate' betyder, at han hadede dem før. Nu spiser han gulerødder, så han kan lide dem."},
