{"l":5836,"g":7,"b":1,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"o","variant":"reverse_meaning","q":"Hvad hedder 'passe' på engelsk i 'These jeans don't ___ me'?","o":["fit","hurt","cost","help"],"a":"fit","r":"'Fit' betyder her at passe (i størrelse)."},
