{"l":6316,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad hedder 'vasketøjet' på engelsk i 'Can you help me hang up the ___?'?","o":["dishes","washing","wash-clothes","washed"],"a":"washing","r":"Vasketøj hedder 'washing' eller 'laundry'. 'Dishes' er opvask."},
{"l":6364,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The new player had never played on a team before. By the end of the season, however, she was the one everyone passed the ball to.' Hvad kan man slutte om den nye spiller?","o":["Hun kunne ikke lide holdet","Hun spillede kun én kamp","Hun blev hurtigt meget god","Hun fik aldrig bolden"],"a":"Hun blev hurtigt meget god","r":"Til sidst ville alle aflevere til hende, så hun var blevet en af de bedste."},
