{"l":6422,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad hedder 'søskende' på engelsk i 'How many ___ do you have?'?","o":["siblings","relatives","cousins","sisterhood"],"a":"siblings","r":"Søskende hedder 'siblings'. 'Relatives' betyder slægtninge."},
{"l":6438,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'The museum ___ we visited had dinosaur bones.'","o":["who","that","where","whose"],"a":"that","r":"Om en ting, man besøgte, bruger man 'that' eller 'which'. 'Where' passer ikke, fordi 'visited' skal have et objekt: vi besøgte museet."},
{"l":6484,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"o","variant":"reverse_meaning","q":"Hvad hedder 'at prøve' på engelsk?","o":["to have a word","to have a laugh","to have a go","to have a rest"],"a":"to have a go","r":"'to have a go' betyder at prøve. 'Have a go' = prøve."},
{"l":6527,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord betyder det modsatte af 'smooth' i 'a smooth road'?","o":["wide","wet","straight","bumpy"],"a":"bumpy","r":"Det modsatte af glat og jævn ('smooth') er ujævn ('bumpy')."},
{"l":6546,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'Although the test was on Monday, Ida only started revising on Sunday evening. She now wishes she had started earlier.' Hvad fortryder Ida?","o":["At hun begyndte for sent","At hun læste for meget","At hun gik til prøven","At hun var syg mandag"],"a":"At hun begyndte for sent","r":"Hun begyndte først at læse søndag aften og ville ønske, hun var startet før."},
{"l":6546,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The recipe says the bread should rise for an hour. Kasper waited ten minutes, put it in the oven and was surprised when it came out flat.' Hvorfor blev brødet fladt?","o":["Ovnen var for varm","Han ventede ikke længe nok","Opskriften var forkert","Han glemte melet"],"a":"Han ventede ikke længe nok","r":"Dejen skulle hæve i en time, men han ventede kun ti minutter."},
{"l":6563,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'Only ___ pupils came to the meeting because of the snow.'","o":["a little","much","a few","little"],"a":"a few","r":"'Pupils' kan tælles, så man bruger 'a few'."},
